'''Kiyotaka Furushima''' (Japanese: '''古島清孝''' ''Furushima Kiyotaka'') is a Japanese voice actor for {{aniseries|PTS}}.

==Biography==
Furushima was born on April 19, 1979, in {{wp|Tochigi Prefecture}}, {{wp|Japan}}, and became a voice actor as an adult. Furushima began voicing characters in {{aniseries|PTS}} toward the midway point of {{aniseries|RS}}. Beginning with {{aniseries|DP}}, he started voicing more notable characters such as [[Paul]]. Furushima is currently affiliated with Tokyo Actor's Consumer's Cooperative Society.

